# Terraform state — holds managed-identity principal and client ids, role
# assignment GUIDs and the attestation providers' URIs. The client id is part
# of the enclave's MEASURED surface (QUILL_AZURE_MI_CLIENT_ID), and the
# authority URIs are what the SKR key's release policy pins, so this file
# describes the trust chain and is treated as sensitive. State is local-only
# by design — see README ("State") for why a remote backend would make one
# cloud a prerequisite for provisioning another.
terraform.tfstate
terraform.tfstate.backup
terraform.tfstate.*.backup

# Provider plugins — large binaries. .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed so every
# operator resolves the same azurerm version; a provider upgrade that changes
# how a resource id is parsed shows up as spurious drift on shared infra.
.terraform/

# Plan output files (created via -out).
*.tfplan
